   "file": "EpsilonEridani/QFT/Scattering/DIS/Kinematics/Basic.lean",
   "fix": "Rewrite with `LinearMap.BilinForm.orthogonal_span_singleton_eq_toLin_ker (B := g.flip) u` (or the more general `Submodule.orthogonalBilin_span_singleton`) first, reducing the goal to `LinearMap.range (g.projOrthogonal u) = LinearMap.ker (g.flip u)`; then `ext v; simp only [LinearMap.mem_range, LinearMap.mem_ker, LinearMap.BilinForm.flip_apply]` and close the two directions with `g.projOrthogonal_orthogonal hu w` and `\u27e8v, (g.projOrthogonal_eq_self_iff hu).mpr hv\u27e9`, dropping the span-singleton plumbing.",
